\begin{description}
\item[* name:] TVPNegAdapt
\item[* relevant examples:] \mbox{}\\
1. I gave not somebody a book $\rightarrow$ I gave nobody a book\\
2. I gave not someone a book $\rightarrow$ I gave noone a book\\
3. I gave them not something $\rightarrow$ I gave them nothing\\
4. ?I put it not somewhere $\rightarrow$ I put it nowhere\\
5. ?I saw him not ever $\rightarrow$ I saw him never
\item[* language:] (Dutch, English, Spanish) English
